SkillDefinition.description:
Wire shape for one entry in the ``get_skill_definitions`` RPC
response. Consumed by the FE autocomplete + SDK skill picker;
``prompt`` may be empty for manifest-only skills.

TruncateHistoryResult.description:
Wire shape for :meth:`ContextController.truncate_history` —
``removed`` is the count of runs dropped (0 on any failure);
``error`` is empty on success.

notifications_counts.doc:
Count the person's unread notifications, in all and per extension.

Takes no arguments. Answers from what was last read, asking nobody;
``notifications_changed`` pushes the counts whenever they move.
